# Financial data never enters this repo: statements, exports, ledger dumps, keys.
# The data folders are anchored to the repo root (leading slash): an unanchored `packs/`
# would also ignore source such as src/rheo_finance/packs/ and tests/packs/.
/data/
/dumps/
/packs/
/staging/
/mail-inbox/
/logs/
*.pdf
*.csv
*.qfx
*.ofx
*.jsonl
*.sqlite
*.db
*.eml
*.dump
*.sql
*.heic
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.zip
.env*
.venv/
__pycache__/
.bureau/

# Local-only context: describes the owner's real accounts and setup. Never committed.
project-context.md
HANDOFF.md

# Synthetic fixtures (fake values, each listed in MANIFEST.toml) stay trackable even with
# statement-like names; scripts/repo_check.py guards what goes in.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/**
